[{"id":20982,"sender_id":396,"sender_full_name":"jim stasheff","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/eeb50cc40b4c9eb22828309e0a393351?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/17-n-Forum/topic/http.3A.2F.2Fbit.2Ely.2F/near/20982\">#1</a> Has anyone had experience with <br>http://bit.ly/<br>seems to be the sort of cutting edge tech that might appeal here</p>","timestamp":1296339471,"subject":"http://bit.ly/","stream_id":17,"display_recipient":"n-Forum","reactions":[]},{"id":20983,"sender_id":78,"sender_full_name":"RodMcGuire","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/93dc0f9f03cdabb6b19a1522bd94c69f?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/17-n-Forum/topic/http.3A.2F.2Fbit.2Ely.2F/near/20983\">#2</a> It is used for URL shortening which seems of no use here. One problem is given such a link you have no idea of where it may lead.\nOutside of Twitter it is favored by spammers and  <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rickrolling\">Rickrollers</a> - like <a href=\"http://bit.ly/7JJSz8\">this</a>.</p>","timestamp":1296340107,"subject":"http://bit.ly/","stream_id":17,"display_recipient":"n-Forum","reactions":[]},{"id":20985,"sender_id":14,"sender_full_name":"TobyBartels","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/7ac66e2e51d2a389b2ab9b2a99100a0c?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/17-n-Forum/topic/http.3A.2F.2Fbit.2Ely.2F/near/20985\">#3</a> I used to use <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/\">http://tinyurl.com/</a>, but all of the kids seem to like bit.ly these days.</p>","timestamp":1296340938,"subject":"http://bit.ly/","stream_id":17,"display_recipient":"n-Forum","reactions":[]},{"id":20991,"sender_id":43,"sender_full_name":"DavidRoberts","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/fbc2dbfb28f9e9275a4fd4cd109b5a21?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/17-n-Forum/topic/http.3A.2F.2Fbit.2Ely.2F/near/20991\">#4</a> Or <a href=\"http://is.gd/\">http://is.gd/</a> or <a href=\"http://goo.gl/\">http://goo.gl/</a>.</p>","timestamp":1296348793,"subject":"http://bit.ly/","stream_id":17,"display_recipient":"n-Forum","reactions":[]}]